      "biography": {
        "value": "<p>O Pokémon Porco. Oinkologne Macho se orgulha de sua pele lisa e brilhante. Ele libera pela ponta da cauda um aroma concentrado e encanta fêmeas com o perfume doce e sedutor que se espalha por todo o corpo.</p><p><strong>SR:</strong> 7 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Nível Mínimo Encontrado:</strong> 5 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Grupo de Ovos:</strong> Campo &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Gênero:</strong> 100% M / 0% F &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Estágio Evolutivo:</strong> 2/2</p><p><strong>Evolução:</strong> Oinkologne Macho é a evolução final de Lechonk.</p><h3>Moves por Nível</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Nível</th><th>Moves adquiridos</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style='text-align:center'>1</td><td>Tackle, Tail Whip</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>2</td><td>Disarming Voice</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>3</td><td>Echoed Voice</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>4</td><td>Mud Shot</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>5</td><td>Covet</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>6</td><td>Dig</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>8</td><td>Headbutt</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>9</td><td>Take Down, Yawn</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>12</td><td>Work Up</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>13</td><td>Uproar</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>14</td><td>Double-Edge</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>15</td><td>Earth Power</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>16</td><td>Belch</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>TMs</h3><p>Body Press, Body Slam, Bulldoze, Bullet Seed, Chilling Water, Curse, Dig, Disarming Voice, Double-Edge, Earth Power, Endeavor, Endure, Energy Ball, Facade, Giga Impact, Helping Hand, High Horsepower, Hyper Beam, Hyper Voice, Iron Head, Lash Out, Mud Shot, Mud-Slap, Play Rough, Protect, Rain Dance, Rest, Seed Bomb, Sleep Talk, Stomping Tantrum, Substitute, Sunny Day, Super Fang, Take Down, Tera Blast, Thief, Trailblaze, Uproar, Zen Headbutt</p>",
